{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "OA Corp Sales：快速尋找下一筆可撥打名單按鈕（支援自動模式）",
  "version": "1.1",
  "description": "(corp-sales-next-list-btn) 在銷售頁面依時間規則快速定位下一筆可撥打的潛在學生名單；自動模式以 40~50 秒隨機間隔自動定位並送出未接聽紀錄",
  "permissions": [
    "activeTab",
    "alarms"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "background.js"
  },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://corp.orangeapple.co/marketing/sales*"
      ],
      "css": [
        "style.css"
      ],
      "js": [
        "content.js"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "icons": {
    "16": "icon16.png",
    "48": "icon48.png",
    "128": "icon128.png"
  }
}